    {
      "paragraph_order": 1,
      "text": "In accordance with the requirements of ASC 606, the disclosure of the impact of adoption on our consolidated\nbalance sheet as of the fiscal year ended February 28, 2019 is as follows:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_order": 2,
      "text": "(1) Deferred product costs included in Prepaid expenses and other current assets and Other assets amounted\nto $6.2 million and $8.8 million, respectively, as of February 28, 2019."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_order": 3,
      "text": "(2) The balances as of February 28, 2019 also included deferred revenue of TRACKER, which was acquired\non February 25, 2019 (see Note 2)."
    },
    {
